1
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:10,660
A thought flashed through my mind:

2
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:14,500
if this went on,

3
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:17,170
we'd both die.

4
00:00:59,220 --> 00:01:05,100
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

5
00:01:07,140 --> 00:01:13,100
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

6
00:01:14,140 --> 00:01:18,380
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

7
00:01:22,060 --> 00:01:29,620
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

8
00:01:29,980 --> 00:01:36,740
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

9
00:01:37,980 --> 00:01:44,620
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

10
00:01:45,820 --> 00:01:52,660
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

11
00:01:54,260 --> 00:02:00,780
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

12
00:02:05,540 --> 00:02:07,340
[Blossom in Darkness]

13
00:02:07,340 --> 00:02:09,340
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

14
00:02:09,340 --> 00:02:12,340
[Episode 4]

15
00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:16,860
After Xiangxue agreed to run away with me,

16
00:02:17,870 --> 00:02:19,050
she destroyed her immortal bones

17
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:21,740
and willingly became an ordinary mortal.

18
00:02:22,040 --> 00:02:23,060
What does any of this

19
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:24,810
have to do with Su Hexiang?

20
00:02:25,270 --> 00:02:26,970
Eerie Cavern is where Su Hexiang and I began.

21
00:02:28,870 --> 00:02:29,970
So you're saying

22
00:02:30,640 --> 00:02:31,890
the place where Xia Xiangxue is trapped

23
00:02:31,890 --> 00:02:32,580
is the Eerie Cavern?

24
00:02:32,920 --> 00:02:33,900
You said you held an umbrella

25
00:02:33,920 --> 00:02:34,900
over her all night.

26
00:02:35,200 --> 00:02:36,570
Does that mean she's still alive?

27
00:02:38,290 --> 00:02:39,130
Can't you find a way

28
00:02:39,130 --> 00:02:39,940
to pull her out?

29
00:02:40,480 --> 00:02:41,300
You're right.

30
00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:43,740
Xiangxue is still alive.

31
00:02:44,640 --> 00:02:46,240
I've tried everything over the years.

32
00:02:46,870 --> 00:02:48,690
But no matter how long a rope I use,

33
00:02:49,590 --> 00:02:50,810
it never reaches the bottom.

34
00:02:51,200 --> 00:02:51,690
That cave...

35
00:02:53,480 --> 00:02:54,530
It seems to go on forever.

36
00:03:14,150 --> 00:03:15,250
Giving up already?

37
00:03:19,380 --> 00:03:20,810
I guess you don't want

38
00:03:21,670 --> 00:03:22,650
to save her that badly after all.

39
00:03:26,990 --> 00:03:27,530
Hexiang.

40
00:03:28,920 --> 00:03:29,460
Hexiang.

41
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,220
You know immortal magic, don't you?

42
00:03:31,430 --> 00:03:32,090
I'm begging you to help me!

43
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:32,810
Please!

44
00:03:37,430 --> 00:03:38,250
It's not that I won't help.

45
00:03:38,760 --> 00:03:40,620
There's no magic in this world

46
00:03:41,080 --> 00:03:42,460
that can overcome Eerie Cavern.

47
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:45,180
Besides,

48
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:47,740
she's better off down there.

49
00:03:51,480 --> 00:03:52,500
No one can die in that cave.

50
00:03:53,670 --> 00:03:54,900
She'll live much longer there

51
00:03:55,830 --> 00:03:56,940
than she would as a mortal.

52
00:03:57,920 --> 00:03:58,530
So...

53
00:03:59,870 --> 00:04:01,370
You deliberately sent us down this path

54
00:04:02,990 --> 00:04:04,300
just to trap her here?

55
00:04:09,710 --> 00:04:10,220
Why?

56
00:04:11,040 --> 00:04:11,850
Why would you do that?

57
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:13,720
She's your senior sister!

58
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:14,410
Then why did you two

59
00:04:14,430 --> 00:04:15,540
sneak away and leave me behind?

60
00:04:15,600 --> 00:04:16,210
All these years...

61
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:17,770
What am I to you people?

62
00:04:25,150 --> 00:04:26,010
I just told you.

63
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:27,980
No one can die in Eerie Cavern.

64
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:30,370
But she can't

65
00:04:30,390 --> 00:04:31,420
get out of that cave, either.

66
00:04:31,710 --> 00:04:32,620
If you want to save her,

67
00:04:33,590 --> 00:04:34,330
I can help you.

68
00:04:35,080 --> 00:04:35,940
Just not right now.

69
00:04:39,230 --> 00:04:40,130
Then how long must I wait?

70
00:04:43,960 --> 00:04:45,060
Until I'm in the mood.

71
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:50,450
What's wrong?

72
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:51,860
Not happy with that?

73
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:55,680
Then poor Xiangxue

74
00:04:56,910 --> 00:04:58,300
will have to spend her life in that cave.

75
00:05:12,440 --> 00:05:13,540
But Su Hexiang still

76
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:14,370
hasn't told you

77
00:05:14,390 --> 00:05:15,450
how to save her.

78
00:05:16,080 --> 00:05:17,340
She's just stringing you along

79
00:05:17,340 --> 00:05:17,970
to make you suffer.

80
00:05:18,080 --> 00:05:18,960
So what?

81
00:05:19,520 --> 00:05:20,450
Xiangxue was trapped

82
00:05:21,030 --> 00:05:21,570
because of me

83
00:05:21,590 --> 00:05:23,250
in that lightless cave for 20 years.

84
00:05:23,790 --> 00:05:24,890
How could I possibly

85
00:05:25,390 --> 00:05:26,210
walk away from her?

86
00:05:27,320 --> 00:05:28,860
After Su Hexiang became sect leader,

87
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:31,810
she grew increasingly unpredictable.

88
00:05:32,150 --> 00:05:33,980
She spent her days indulging in pleasure.

89
00:05:34,640 --> 00:05:35,690
She began taking on disciples in droves.

90
00:05:36,200 --> 00:05:36,660
Her only goal

91
00:05:37,470 --> 00:05:38,810
was to drain their vital energy

92
00:05:39,030 --> 00:05:41,100
to advance her cultivation.

93
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:48,500
Then why

94
00:05:49,270 --> 00:05:50,890
did she seal those people in jars?

95
00:05:51,350 --> 00:05:51,890
Because that way,

96
00:05:51,910 --> 00:05:52,890
she could keep them alive.

97
00:05:53,640 --> 00:05:54,450
As long as they were still breathing,

98
00:05:55,030 --> 00:05:56,060
their vital energy would recover.

99
00:05:56,640 --> 00:05:57,500
But if she keeps doing this,

100
00:05:58,080 --> 00:05:59,450
the malice will eventually consume her.

101
00:06:00,470 --> 00:06:02,180
Yet her aura remains perfectly pure.

102
00:06:02,760 --> 00:06:04,010
She draws the malice from her body,

103
00:06:04,270 --> 00:06:05,010
turns it into blood,

104
00:06:05,470 --> 00:06:06,330
and feeds it to Eerie Cavern.

105
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:08,010
I don't know if her evil grew too strong

106
00:06:08,590 --> 00:06:10,180
or the seal on Mount Qihuang was broken.

107
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:12,330
But after Qi Fengyin was unleashed,

108
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:13,690
Eerie Cavern began

109
00:06:13,710 --> 00:06:14,500
releasing malice into the world.

110
00:06:15,350 --> 00:06:15,980
Even the disciples

111
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:17,060
who came from Mount Zhaowu

112
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:18,370
were affected.

113
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:19,300
What exactly

114
00:06:19,830 --> 00:06:20,690
is Eerie Cavern?

115
00:06:22,150 --> 00:06:24,100
I later searched the ancient texts in secret.

116
00:06:25,230 --> 00:06:26,770
I barely found a few scattered references.

117
00:06:27,390 --> 00:06:28,620
Eerie Cavern is a creation of Heaven.

118
00:06:29,350 --> 00:06:30,330
It is neither good nor evil.

119
00:06:31,570 --> 00:06:32,580
It consumes anything

120
00:06:32,940 --> 00:06:34,130
it can absorb.

121
00:06:35,140 --> 00:06:36,830
It has always existed here.

122
00:06:37,090 --> 00:06:38,180
Once you fall into it,

123
00:06:38,790 --> 00:06:39,980
there's no way out.

124
00:06:41,640 --> 00:06:42,660
If we can find a way

125
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:43,860
to seal Eerie Cavern temporarily

126
00:06:44,710 --> 00:06:46,050
and stop it from spreading malice

127
00:06:46,050 --> 00:06:46,830
and clouding our senses,

128
00:06:47,590 --> 00:06:49,650
we might be able to find Su Hexiang.

129
00:06:51,320 --> 00:06:52,200
Take us to Eerie Cavern.

130
00:07:02,080 --> 00:07:02,620
Sis.

131
00:07:02,960 --> 00:07:03,940
Don't call me that.

132
00:07:05,320 --> 00:07:06,420
Not even when we're alone.

133
00:07:08,260 --> 00:07:08,790
Forgive me.

134
00:07:09,200 --> 00:07:10,340
I forgot myself in the heat of the moment.

135
00:07:17,390 --> 00:07:17,970
Yinhua.

136
00:07:18,880 --> 00:07:19,590
How are you feeling?

137
00:07:20,520 --> 00:07:21,800
My brother just

138
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:23,230
transferred some spiritual energy to me.

139
00:07:23,510 --> 00:07:24,210
I'm fine now.

140
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:24,730
Yinhua

141
00:07:24,870 --> 00:07:26,140
still needs time to recover.

142
00:07:26,510 --> 00:07:27,660
How is Zhiwei?

143
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:28,900
He's still unconscious.

144
00:07:29,920 --> 00:07:30,460
Yinhua,

145
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:32,930
why did Zhiwei suddenly stab you?

146
00:07:34,870 --> 00:07:35,660
I don't know either.

147
00:07:36,510 --> 00:07:38,700
He suddenly seemed possessed.

148
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:40,220
He kept muttering

149
00:07:40,430 --> 00:07:41,540
that he wanted to kill you

150
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:44,580
and take your place as chief disciple.

151
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:48,170
I was goaded.

152
00:07:48,190 --> 00:07:48,850
By whom?

153
00:07:49,070 --> 00:07:50,930
This man is nothing but trouble!

154
00:07:51,070 --> 00:07:52,140
Last night, I saw it all!

155
00:07:52,510 --> 00:07:53,250
He was using both hands

156
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:54,900
to absorb black mist from the sky!

157
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:55,420
Silence!

158
00:07:55,630 --> 00:07:56,400
I really have no

159
00:07:56,400 --> 00:07:57,350
improper intentions toward you.

160
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:58,660
I just want you to take me away!

161
00:07:58,680 --> 00:07:59,820
The man I brought back...

162
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:00,800
He's actually...

163
00:08:01,830 --> 00:08:03,580
I had nothing to do with what happened there.

164
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:04,730
My affairs

165
00:08:05,750 --> 00:08:06,850
are none of your concern either.

166
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:09,370
Hao.

167
00:08:10,040 --> 00:08:11,220
Have you discovered something else?

168
00:08:11,270 --> 00:08:12,140
Something is wrong on Mount Leiguan.

169
00:08:12,870 --> 00:08:13,340
Qingxing.

170
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:15,100
Leave Yinhua in another disciple's care.

171
00:08:15,390 --> 00:08:16,900
Hurry to Luoshen Valley and bring Master here.

172
00:08:17,190 --> 00:08:17,930
It's extremely urgent.

173
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:18,810
Don't waste a moment.

174
00:08:19,830 --> 00:08:20,460
Hao.

175
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:21,410
Where are you going?

176
00:08:31,430 --> 00:08:32,060
Are you all right?

177
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:34,700
Just an old ailment acting up.

178
00:08:35,510 --> 00:08:36,340
Will this really

179
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:38,250
help us find Xiangxue?

180
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:39,730
Of course it will.

181
00:08:40,630 --> 00:08:41,180
This

182
00:08:42,510 --> 00:08:43,340
is Eerie Cavern.

183
00:09:13,510 --> 00:09:14,850
It's the cave from my dream.

184
00:09:15,910 --> 00:09:16,420
Well?

185
00:09:16,630 --> 00:09:17,490
I'll seal it.

186
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:37,850
I knew it was you.

187
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:39,610
Qi Fengyin.

188
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:42,060
I never imagined you could be so cunning,

189
00:09:42,750 --> 00:09:44,060
using such a vile trick

190
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:44,700
to deceive me.

191
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:53,010
You're the source of all evil in this world,

192
00:09:53,510 --> 00:09:54,420
rejected by Heaven and Earth.

193
00:09:55,200 --> 00:09:56,060
Prepare to die!

194
00:09:56,910 --> 00:09:57,700
Why is he here?

195
00:09:58,080 --> 00:09:59,490
When did he see through our plan?

196
00:10:01,390 --> 00:10:02,370
I have no time for you.

197
00:10:02,910 --> 00:10:03,820
You're not worth killing.

198
00:10:04,150 --> 00:10:05,490
Go back if you want to live.

199
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:43,650
Fengxian, save me!

200
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:57,580
I lied when I said I held no grudges.

201
00:11:08,270 --> 00:11:08,820
Master,

202
00:11:09,510 --> 00:11:10,610
I've finally avenged you.

203
00:11:34,630 --> 00:11:36,180
You lured His Lordship here

204
00:11:37,630 --> 00:11:39,610
just to push him into Eerie Cavern?

205
00:11:41,750 --> 00:11:42,770
He destroyed Luoshen Valley

206
00:11:43,270 --> 00:11:44,220
and gravely wounded my Master,

207
00:11:45,080 --> 00:11:45,940
then drew his sword to kill me

208
00:11:45,960 --> 00:11:46,940
and severed my arm.

209
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:49,850
He should've known this day would come.

210
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:53,220
She's not Su Hexiang.

211
00:11:54,030 --> 00:11:54,890
Then who is she?

212
00:12:09,240 --> 00:12:09,820
It's you?

213
00:12:11,200 --> 00:12:11,850
Master,

214
00:12:12,670 --> 00:12:14,220
could you send others to find her?

215
00:12:15,390 --> 00:12:16,010
I know

216
00:12:16,390 --> 00:12:17,580
you've never liked that girl.

217
00:12:24,390 --> 00:12:25,100
Hao!

218
00:12:31,240 --> 00:12:31,850
Hao.

219
00:12:32,200 --> 00:12:32,820
Yamao.

220
00:12:33,390 --> 00:12:34,250
You remember me?

221
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:36,770
You were always so rebellious,

222
00:12:37,390 --> 00:12:38,650
causing endless trouble on Mount Zhaowu.

223
00:12:39,080 --> 00:12:39,730
Of course I remember.

224
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:40,980
So that's your game, Yamao.

225
00:12:41,200 --> 00:12:42,610
You've been working with those immortal hounds!

226
00:12:52,960 --> 00:12:53,980
What is going on here?

227
00:12:54,870 --> 00:12:55,460
Why

228
00:12:55,670 --> 00:12:57,010
are you mixed up with Qi Fengyin?

229
00:12:57,630 --> 00:12:58,180
And why

230
00:12:58,630 --> 00:12:59,770
are you disguised as Su Hexiang?

231
00:13:00,550 --> 00:13:01,700
- And this demon woman... - She's not a demon!

232
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:03,700
She's my doll.

233
00:13:06,480 --> 00:13:07,300
What exactly

234
00:13:08,200 --> 00:13:09,220
happened to you these past few days?

235
00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:12,420
It was Qi Fengyin.

236
00:13:13,120 --> 00:13:14,730
He made me look like Su Hexiang.

237
00:13:15,480 --> 00:13:16,640
I wanted to tell you

238
00:13:16,640 --> 00:13:17,250
the whole truth.

239
00:13:18,030 --> 00:13:18,580
But...

240
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:20,000
I was afraid you'd get dragged into it

241
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:21,130
and get killed by Qi Fengyin.

242
00:13:23,080 --> 00:13:24,420
Then I heard about Eerie Cavern.

243
00:13:25,270 --> 00:13:25,980
Once fall in,

244
00:13:26,270 --> 00:13:27,220
there's no way to climb back out.

245
00:13:27,670 --> 00:13:28,770
Only then did I dare take the risk.

246
00:13:29,150 --> 00:13:29,700
So,

247
00:13:30,750 --> 00:13:31,610
you led us to Eerie Cavern

248
00:13:31,960 --> 00:13:33,010
not to find Su Hexiang,

249
00:13:33,550 --> 00:13:34,650
but to trap Qi Fengyin?

250
00:13:35,030 --> 00:13:35,530
Of course.

251
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:37,180
But we still need to find Su Hexiang.

252
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:40,370
I heard some Mount Zhaowu disciples

253
00:13:40,510 --> 00:13:41,490
had been affected by Eerie Cavern.

254
00:13:41,790 --> 00:13:42,250
I figured

255
00:13:42,270 --> 00:13:43,530
you'd come here to investigate.

256
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:45,060
With Qi Fengyin distracted by you,

257
00:13:45,600 --> 00:13:46,880
he wouldn't notice

258
00:13:46,880 --> 00:13:47,680
what I was really planning.

259
00:13:48,360 --> 00:13:49,730
What if I'd kept Qi Fengyin occupied?

260
00:13:50,390 --> 00:13:51,730
What if he hadn't come to save you in time?

261
00:13:52,080 --> 00:13:52,980
Did you think about what could've happened?

262
00:13:54,150 --> 00:13:55,490
If this cave really is so dangerous,

263
00:13:56,510 --> 00:13:56,890
how could you

264
00:13:56,960 --> 00:13:58,010
risk your life like that?

265
00:13:58,790 --> 00:13:59,250
Yamao,

266
00:13:59,790 --> 00:14:00,460
there's a limit

267
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:01,730
to how reckless you can be.

268
00:14:01,870 --> 00:14:03,010
We're talking about Qi Fengyin.

269
00:14:03,480 --> 00:14:04,490
He's the devil

270
00:14:04,550 --> 00:14:06,010
who's terrified the immortal sects for a thousand years.

271
00:14:06,270 --> 00:14:07,370
How could I possibly stand against him?

272
00:14:07,960 --> 00:14:09,010
I only had one chance.

273
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:10,300
I had to go all in

274
00:14:10,750 --> 00:14:11,730
to lure him into my trap.

275
00:14:12,390 --> 00:14:13,010
Besides,

276
00:14:14,840 --> 00:14:16,010
I have to save my Master.

277
00:14:20,630 --> 00:14:21,890
High Immortal Danshen is alive?

278
00:14:22,600 --> 00:14:24,060
My Master was protecting the shrine

279
00:14:24,630 --> 00:14:25,580
when he was gravely wounded and nearly died.

280
00:14:26,030 --> 00:14:27,250
He turned into this crystal.

281
00:14:28,150 --> 00:14:29,700
I was going to Mount Zhaowu for help,

282
00:14:30,840 --> 00:14:32,770
but I ran into Su Hexiang on the way

283
00:14:33,120 --> 00:14:34,420
and had to hide on Mount Qihuang.

284
00:14:35,320 --> 00:14:35,820
I'm sorry.

285
00:14:36,960 --> 00:14:38,770
I wish I'd realized all this sooner.

286
00:14:40,870 --> 00:14:41,770
But why

287
00:14:42,390 --> 00:14:43,220
did you go along

288
00:14:43,390 --> 00:14:44,850
with Qi Fengyin's act in the chamber?

289
00:14:47,630 --> 00:14:47,890
Well...

290
00:14:48,320 --> 00:14:49,340
It's a long story.

291
00:14:49,600 --> 00:14:50,890
I'll tell you everything later.

292
00:14:51,390 --> 00:14:52,650
Right now, what matters most

293
00:14:52,870 --> 00:14:53,850
is finding Su Hexiang.

294
00:14:56,120 --> 00:14:56,700
Lu Liangsheng,

295
00:14:57,270 --> 00:14:58,420
I promised to help you escape

296
00:14:58,600 --> 00:14:59,490
and save your wife.

297
00:14:59,870 --> 00:15:00,890
I intend to keep both promises.

298
00:15:01,360 --> 00:15:03,060
But could you think back

299
00:15:03,480 --> 00:15:04,300
and tell me what other secrets

300
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:06,420
Mount Leiguan might be hiding?

301
00:15:07,030 --> 00:15:08,340
Where Su Hexiang could be hiding?

302
00:15:08,630 --> 00:15:09,460
There's a secret passage

303
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:10,820
in her chamber

304
00:15:11,270 --> 00:15:12,060
that leads to the hill out back.

305
00:15:12,670 --> 00:15:13,850
She uses it to dispose of

306
00:15:14,910 --> 00:15:16,220
the disciples she's drained of vital energy.

307
00:15:18,320 --> 00:15:19,010
What did you say?

308
00:15:19,240 --> 00:15:20,180
Then take us there.

309
00:15:41,870 --> 00:15:42,580
Stay close to me.

310
00:15:51,960 --> 00:15:53,130
High Immortal Danshen's spirit is still intact.

311
00:15:53,440 --> 00:15:54,060
That's a good sign.

312
00:15:54,630 --> 00:15:55,610
You needn't worry too much.

313
00:15:56,150 --> 00:15:57,100
Once we return to Mount Zhaowu,

314
00:15:57,510 --> 00:15:58,580
my Master can surely save him.

315
00:15:58,630 --> 00:15:59,300
That's wonderful!

316
00:16:00,510 --> 00:16:01,490
I never imagined

317
00:16:01,960 --> 00:16:03,420
Mount Leiguan held such dark secrets.

318
00:16:03,910 --> 00:16:04,980
Only by capturing Su Hexiang

319
00:16:05,440 --> 00:16:06,940
can we put an end to this tragedy.

320
00:16:34,630 --> 00:16:35,490
Su Hexiang.

321
00:16:36,630 --> 00:16:37,770
Well done.

322
00:16:39,960 --> 00:16:41,130
You're working for Su Hexiang?

323
00:16:43,960 --> 00:16:45,180
You said you wanted to save your wife.

324
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:46,940
Was that all a lie?

325
00:16:50,030 --> 00:16:50,610
I'm sorry.

326
00:16:51,080 --> 00:16:51,610
I'm so sorry.

327
00:16:51,840 --> 00:16:52,890
I never wanted to hurt you.

328
00:16:53,670 --> 00:16:54,490
But for Xiangxue's sake,

329
00:16:55,480 --> 00:16:56,460
I had no choice.

330
00:16:56,720 --> 00:16:58,100
I see he hasn't told you.

331
00:16:59,080 --> 00:17:00,770
I taught him how to save her long ago.

332
00:17:03,030 --> 00:17:05,250
He needs hair from a thousand men,

333
00:17:05,550 --> 00:17:06,490
soaked in spiritual energy

334
00:17:07,240 --> 00:17:08,400
and twisted into a rope.

335
00:17:09,200 --> 00:17:10,180
Then he can use it

336
00:17:10,790 --> 00:17:12,050
to pull Xiangxue out of Eerie Cavern.

337
00:17:12,790 --> 00:17:13,530
Madam, look.

338
00:17:13,750 --> 00:17:14,980
Those pills you gave me...

339
00:17:15,030 --> 00:17:16,180
I've only taken them for a few days,

340
00:17:16,200 --> 00:17:17,250
and my hair is already

341
00:17:17,270 --> 00:17:18,330
jet-black and shiny.

342
00:17:18,550 --> 00:17:20,010
There's something strange about those people in jars.

343
00:17:20,590 --> 00:17:21,380
Their bodies are withered,

344
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:23,810
yet their hair is unusually thick.

345
00:17:24,110 --> 00:17:24,810
So

346
00:17:26,030 --> 00:17:27,460
you sealed those people in jars

347
00:17:28,030 --> 00:17:29,050
and kept them barely alive

348
00:17:29,480 --> 00:17:30,700
so their hair

349
00:17:30,750 --> 00:17:31,530
would keep growing?

350
00:17:32,030 --> 00:17:32,620
Exactly.

351
00:17:35,070 --> 00:17:35,980
All these years,

352
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:39,380
everyone who helped me

353
00:17:40,350 --> 00:17:41,460
cultivate my powers became his reward.

354
00:17:42,550 --> 00:17:43,570
Didn't you say

355
00:17:44,720 --> 00:17:45,730
you'd help him save Xiangxue?

356
00:17:46,350 --> 00:17:47,530
Hair from a thousand men.

357
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:49,810
Can you manage that?

358
00:17:57,400 --> 00:17:57,940
To preserve

359
00:17:57,960 --> 00:17:59,330
the spiritual energy in their hair,

360
00:18:00,680 --> 00:18:01,920
I buried them underground

361
00:18:01,920 --> 00:18:02,810
to keep them growing.

362
00:18:03,590 --> 00:18:04,330
And now,

363
00:18:04,920 --> 00:18:06,700
we've collected 999 strands.

364
00:18:07,510 --> 00:18:08,330
Just one more to go.

365
00:18:09,680 --> 00:18:11,490
Do you really think he'd let

366
00:18:12,030 --> 00:18:13,050
all that effort go to waste?

367
00:18:14,680 --> 00:18:15,330
Liangsheng,

368
00:18:15,880 --> 00:18:16,490
what do you say?

369
00:18:26,750 --> 00:18:27,490
Who would've thought

370
00:18:28,720 --> 00:18:29,730
you had it in you

371
00:18:30,270 --> 00:18:31,250
to help the immortal sects

372
00:18:31,720 --> 00:18:32,900
get rid of Qi Fengyin,

373
00:18:32,900 --> 00:18:33,620
their greatest threat?

374
00:18:34,310 --> 00:18:35,750
Looks like you, a mystical herb,

375
00:18:36,030 --> 00:18:37,190
really are something special.

376
00:18:37,750 --> 00:18:39,330
Not only can you help people ascend,

377
00:18:40,110 --> 00:18:41,490
you can do all this, too.

378
00:19:25,270 --> 00:19:25,770
Watch out!

379
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:32,250
Hao.

380
00:19:42,160 --> 00:19:43,050
You're badly wounded.

381
00:19:44,240 --> 00:19:45,250
I'll wait right here

382
00:19:45,880 --> 00:19:47,530
and see how far you can run.

383
00:19:52,550 --> 00:19:53,380
It's a dead end.

384
00:19:55,920 --> 00:19:56,530
Hao!

385
00:20:08,750 --> 00:20:10,330
Lu Liangsheng's wife is trapped in Eerie Cavern

386
00:20:11,110 --> 00:20:12,490
because of Su Hexiang.

387
00:20:13,720 --> 00:20:14,770
I never imagined

388
00:20:15,350 --> 00:20:16,730
he'd turn against us like that.

389
00:20:19,590 --> 00:20:20,700
I was careless to trust him.

390
00:20:21,830 --> 00:20:22,380
And I put you in danger.

391
00:20:22,590 --> 00:20:23,290
It's not your fault.

392
00:20:24,200 --> 00:20:25,090
I'm just not strong enough.

393
00:20:30,270 --> 00:20:31,090
That smells wonderful.

394
00:20:31,350 --> 00:20:33,080
It's the Moonlit Revival Herb.

395
00:20:33,640 --> 00:20:34,380
Watch out for that doll.

396
00:20:44,920 --> 00:20:45,570
My ring.

397
00:20:46,240 --> 00:20:46,900
Without my ring,

398
00:20:47,030 --> 00:20:48,090
I can't suppress the energy in my blood.

399
00:20:50,440 --> 00:20:51,980
But Youyou's true form is already a doll.

400
00:20:53,200 --> 00:20:54,730
Why would my blood still attract her?

401
00:20:56,240 --> 00:20:57,700
You said Eerie Cavern spreads malice.

402
00:20:59,030 --> 00:21:00,500
The doll must've been affected.

403
00:21:00,500 --> 00:21:01,380
It's lost its senses,

404
00:21:01,790 --> 00:21:03,010
and its inner demons have taken over.

405
00:21:04,240 --> 00:21:05,580
Then I'll tie it up tighter

406
00:21:05,590 --> 00:21:06,330
so it can't cause trouble.

407
00:21:17,310 --> 00:21:18,010
Hao.

408
00:21:18,550 --> 00:21:19,050
Your wound...

409
00:21:19,070 --> 00:21:19,460
I'm fine.

410
00:21:20,440 --> 00:21:21,460
A little meditation and rest

411
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:22,940
should help me recover.

412
00:21:52,200 --> 00:21:53,140
You're pushing yourself too hard.

413
00:21:53,790 --> 00:21:54,620
Don't you care

414
00:21:54,640 --> 00:21:55,380
if you live or die?

415
00:21:56,920 --> 00:21:57,570
Yuwen Hao,

416
00:21:58,240 --> 00:21:59,490
in recent years,

417
00:21:59,510 --> 00:22:00,250
your cultivation hasn't advanced at all.

418
00:22:01,270 --> 00:22:01,860
You no longer deserve

419
00:22:01,880 --> 00:22:02,980
to be Mount Zhaowu's chief disciple.

420
00:22:04,030 --> 00:22:05,180
Looks like you, a mystical herb,

421
00:22:05,720 --> 00:22:06,900
really are something special.

422
00:22:07,480 --> 00:22:09,140
Not only can you help people ascend,

423
00:22:09,880 --> 00:22:11,090
you can do all this, too.

424
00:22:26,160 --> 00:22:26,620
What's wrong?

425
00:22:31,510 --> 00:22:32,220
Hao?

426
00:22:34,240 --> 00:22:34,900
Yamao.

427
00:22:36,200 --> 00:22:36,980
Your wound...

428
00:22:54,240 --> 00:22:54,860
What's happening to you?

429
00:22:57,640 --> 00:22:58,380
I'm afraid

430
00:22:59,550 --> 00:23:00,700
Eerie Cavern has affected me, too.

431
00:23:04,350 --> 00:23:05,050
Hao.

432
00:23:05,590 --> 00:23:06,530
You have to fight it!

433
00:23:07,400 --> 00:23:08,290
You're the admired

434
00:23:08,290 --> 00:23:09,220
chief disciple of Mount Zhaowu,

435
00:23:09,440 --> 00:23:10,180
the pride of the immortal sects.

436
00:23:10,590 --> 00:23:11,420
You've devoted your life to fighting evil.

437
00:23:11,640 --> 00:23:12,380
You always stand for what's right.

438
00:23:12,720 --> 00:23:13,180
You'd never

439
00:23:13,200 --> 00:23:14,220
become someone like Su Hexiang...

440
00:23:36,480 --> 00:23:37,290
Think carefully.

441
00:23:38,110 --> 00:23:39,050
My Master and Mount Zhaowu

442
00:23:39,070 --> 00:23:39,810
have always been close.

443
00:23:40,200 --> 00:23:41,050
If you hurt me,

444
00:23:41,310 --> 00:23:42,180
you'll lose your spiritual mark,

445
00:23:42,480 --> 00:23:43,810
and your Master will never forgive you!

446
00:23:44,110 --> 00:23:44,860
Yuwen Hao,

447
00:23:45,510 --> 00:23:46,420
your cultivation

448
00:23:46,420 --> 00:23:47,570
has stagnated for years.

449
00:23:48,070 --> 00:23:48,660
Eat her,

450
00:23:49,260 --> 00:23:50,460
and you'll become immortal at once.

451
00:23:51,310 --> 00:23:52,080
Don't come any closer!

452
00:23:52,590 --> 00:23:53,330
I don't want to hurt you.

453
00:23:53,790 --> 00:23:54,620
Killing someone

454
00:23:54,640 --> 00:23:55,590
for your own selfish desires?

455
00:23:56,110 --> 00:23:57,460
How could you face your sect?

456
00:23:58,680 --> 00:23:59,940
She's a mystical herb

457
00:24:00,680 --> 00:24:01,420
in her true form, not a human!

458
00:24:32,440 --> 00:24:33,860
Qi... Qi Fengyin.

459
00:24:35,200 --> 00:24:36,490
How did you get out of Eerie Cavern?

460
00:24:38,880 --> 00:24:40,490
How many times have you lied to me?

461
00:24:43,240 --> 00:24:43,660
I...

462
00:24:45,750 --> 00:24:46,620
So now you're afraid?

463
00:24:48,750 --> 00:24:49,730
If you knew you'd be afraid,

464
00:24:50,640 --> 00:24:52,090
why did you do it?

465
00:24:57,680 --> 00:24:58,010
I...

466
00:24:59,310 --> 00:24:59,820
If you're going to kill me,

467
00:24:59,820 --> 00:25:00,880
please make it quick.

468
00:25:01,070 --> 00:25:02,250
Don't keep me alive just to torture me.

469
00:25:02,680 --> 00:25:03,700
I don't want to kill you.

470
00:25:05,000 --> 00:25:06,420
And I have no interest in torturing you.

471
00:25:07,480 --> 00:25:09,770
But a promise is a promise.

472
00:25:11,680 --> 00:25:13,570
Now it's time to keep yours.

473
00:25:16,270 --> 00:25:17,330
I rather like

474
00:25:17,350 --> 00:25:18,180
Su Hexiang's method.

475
00:25:20,680 --> 00:25:21,860
I'll seal you in a jar

476
00:25:22,000 --> 00:25:23,540
to nourish my flower.

477
00:25:29,830 --> 00:25:30,770
Su Hexiang, the one you're looking for,

478
00:25:31,030 --> 00:25:31,700
is right outside!

479
00:25:42,750 --> 00:25:43,490
Qi Fengyin?

480
00:25:48,440 --> 00:25:49,760
How did you escape Eerie Cavern?

481
00:25:50,350 --> 00:25:51,290
Did you see Xiangxue?

482
00:26:40,350 --> 00:26:40,730
No!

483
00:26:41,350 --> 00:26:41,730
No!

484
00:26:42,750 --> 00:26:44,050
That's the only thing that can save Xiangxue!

485
00:26:46,280 --> 00:26:46,770
Go!

486
00:26:48,440 --> 00:26:48,860
Go!

487
00:27:24,030 --> 00:27:24,570
Don't move.

488
00:27:35,440 --> 00:27:36,260
I'm hurt?

489
00:27:36,480 --> 00:27:37,570
You're dying.

490
00:27:38,880 --> 00:27:39,180
I...

491
00:27:39,310 --> 00:27:39,900
Sit still.

492
00:27:48,070 --> 00:27:49,180
Why am I so unlucky?

493
00:27:49,720 --> 00:27:51,120
I'm still young,

494
00:27:51,120 --> 00:27:52,250
beautiful, and in my prime.

495
00:27:52,550 --> 00:27:53,700
I can't die like this.

496
00:27:55,880 --> 00:27:56,620
Qi Fengyin,

497
00:27:57,030 --> 00:27:58,090
you have to save me!

498
00:27:59,550 --> 00:28:00,700
I know

499
00:28:00,720 --> 00:28:02,380
you're still angry about the Eerie Cavern.

500
00:28:03,880 --> 00:28:06,010
But that place was full of malice.

501
00:28:06,480 --> 00:28:09,290
I just lost my head for a moment.

502
00:28:09,510 --> 00:28:10,570
The cave got into my mind,

503
00:28:10,960 --> 00:28:12,420
and that's why I made

504
00:28:13,030 --> 00:28:14,140
one tiny mistake.

505
00:28:15,510 --> 00:28:17,250
You lost your head?

506
00:28:18,070 --> 00:28:19,290
The cave influenced you?

507
00:28:20,000 --> 00:28:22,090
Lu Liangsheng said the Mount Zhaowu disciples

508
00:28:22,350 --> 00:28:23,660
were affected by the cave, too.

509
00:28:24,110 --> 00:28:25,290
I think that was the moment

510
00:28:26,270 --> 00:28:27,940
you started plotting against me.

511
00:28:28,510 --> 00:28:29,140
Am I right?

512
00:28:31,200 --> 00:28:32,460
Putting that aside,

513
00:28:32,830 --> 00:28:34,220
your mystical flower is innocent.

514
00:28:34,750 --> 00:28:35,620
How can you let this little sprout

515
00:28:35,640 --> 00:28:36,460
die along with me?

516
00:28:36,720 --> 00:28:37,180
I know...

517
00:29:02,000 --> 00:29:03,010
What's happening?

518
00:29:03,440 --> 00:29:05,250
This thing is draining your blood and life force.

519
00:29:05,790 --> 00:29:06,810
Some of the hair

520
00:29:07,110 --> 00:29:08,180
has already burrowed deep into your body.

521
00:29:08,680 --> 00:29:09,700
What I'm doing now

522
00:29:11,030 --> 00:29:12,620
will only slow your death.

523
00:29:14,110 --> 00:29:14,660
What?

524
00:29:15,110 --> 00:29:15,460
I...

525
00:29:18,720 --> 00:29:19,770
It must be Su Hexiang.

526
00:29:20,350 --> 00:29:21,420
To keep this hair

527
00:29:21,420 --> 00:29:22,210
alive,

528
00:29:22,550 --> 00:29:23,940
she must've used some forbidden technique

529
00:29:24,270 --> 00:29:25,630
to make it greedily absorb

530
00:29:25,630 --> 00:29:26,490
every bit of nourishment it can find.

531
00:29:31,160 --> 00:29:31,850
It's okay.

532
00:29:32,240 --> 00:29:32,730
It's okay.

533
00:29:33,680 --> 00:29:34,330
After everything

534
00:29:34,350 --> 00:29:35,860
I've been through lately,

535
00:29:35,920 --> 00:29:36,620
there has to be a way out.

536
00:29:37,720 --> 00:29:38,460
Where's Youyou?

537
00:29:38,830 --> 00:29:39,740
Maybe she knows

538
00:29:39,740 --> 00:29:40,860
what we should do.

539
00:29:44,830 --> 00:29:46,180
She's not in her right mind.

540
00:29:46,750 --> 00:29:47,530
If we let her out,

541
00:29:48,240 --> 00:29:48,980
she'll just

542
00:29:48,980 --> 00:29:50,090
keep attacking you.

543
00:29:51,400 --> 00:29:53,530
So much for being an ancient demon.

544
00:29:54,030 --> 00:29:55,290
She's useless when it matters most.

545
00:30:01,200 --> 00:30:01,940
Qi Fengyin,

546
00:30:02,200 --> 00:30:03,460
in your original plan,

547
00:30:03,680 --> 00:30:04,380
were you going to

548
00:30:04,550 --> 00:30:05,290
kill Su Hexiang

549
00:30:05,310 --> 00:30:06,460
whether you

550
00:30:08,350 --> 00:30:09,620
got the malice or not?

551
00:30:15,830 --> 00:30:16,900
She had to die.

552
00:30:33,640 --> 00:30:34,250
You're hurt.

553
00:30:35,310 --> 00:30:35,980
Come on, let's sit down.

554
00:31:16,640 --> 00:31:16,980
Does it hurt?

555
00:31:22,880 --> 00:31:24,140
You have always been stubborn.

556
00:31:24,590 --> 00:31:25,530
You keep your feelings

557
00:31:25,680 --> 00:31:26,530
bottled up inside.

558
00:31:27,440 --> 00:31:28,490
How is anyone supposed to know?

559
00:31:44,510 --> 00:31:45,290
I never thought

560
00:31:46,790 --> 00:31:48,010
you'd actually tend to my wounds.

561
00:31:49,270 --> 00:31:50,010
I thought

562
00:31:50,440 --> 00:31:52,140
you hated me with all your heart.

563
00:31:52,750 --> 00:31:53,620
There's no need

564
00:31:54,160 --> 00:31:55,330
for those veiled insults.

565
00:31:57,440 --> 00:31:58,490
I've never forgotten

566
00:31:59,160 --> 00:32:00,420
how close we once were, like family.

567
00:32:02,640 --> 00:32:03,570
Like family?

568
00:32:06,790 --> 00:32:08,290
The three of us met at the same time.

569
00:32:09,070 --> 00:32:10,330
We were inseparable.

570
00:32:11,070 --> 00:32:12,460
Why was I only ever a family to you,

571
00:32:12,480 --> 00:32:13,620
while you and Xiangxue

572
00:32:13,680 --> 00:32:14,660
fell in love?

573
00:32:16,070 --> 00:32:16,810
It was my fault.

574
00:32:18,640 --> 00:32:19,810
I shouldn't have fallen for Xiangxue.

575
00:32:23,400 --> 00:32:24,860
Whatever punishment you have for me,

576
00:32:25,720 --> 00:32:26,460
I'll accept it.

577
00:32:30,790 --> 00:32:32,090
But please, I'm begging you. Save Xiangxue.

578
00:32:33,160 --> 00:32:33,700
20 years.

579
00:32:34,920 --> 00:32:36,090
I've spent 20 years gathering that hair.

580
00:32:37,440 --> 00:32:37,980
All that hair

581
00:32:38,000 --> 00:32:39,420
was ripped out by that man.

582
00:32:39,960 --> 00:32:40,860
Once tonight is over,

583
00:32:42,400 --> 00:32:43,620
everything I've worked for

584
00:32:45,110 --> 00:32:46,380
these past 20 years will be lost.

585
00:32:48,960 --> 00:32:49,860
And I have no idea

586
00:32:49,860 --> 00:32:50,940
when I'll ever see Xiangxue again.

587
00:32:56,030 --> 00:32:57,330
Please, I'm begging you to save her.

588
00:32:58,310 --> 00:32:58,980
I'm begging you.

589
00:33:02,510 --> 00:33:04,140
What a touching display of devotion.

590
00:33:06,830 --> 00:33:08,570
My senior sister certainly found herself a devoted man.

591
00:33:14,920 --> 00:33:15,490
Enough.

592
00:33:17,920 --> 00:33:18,770
I'm tired, too.

593
00:33:20,640 --> 00:33:21,810
I don't want to make things harder for you anymore.

594
00:33:31,920 --> 00:33:33,330
Do one thing for me,

595
00:33:35,440 --> 00:33:36,730
and you can save Xiangxue.

596
00:33:40,550 --> 00:33:41,050
Did you

597
00:33:41,750 --> 00:33:42,570
see Xia Xiangxue

598
00:33:42,590 --> 00:33:43,490
at the bottom of the cave?

599
00:33:45,270 --> 00:33:45,900
I don't know.

600
00:33:46,640 --> 00:33:47,730
How could you not know?

601
00:33:52,110 --> 00:33:53,570
I don't remember much about

602
00:33:54,440 --> 00:33:55,420
what happened inside Eerie Cavern.

603
00:33:56,030 --> 00:33:56,980
All I remember is that

604
00:33:58,640 --> 00:33:59,980
something I can't even describe

605
00:34:00,030 --> 00:34:01,140
tried to trap me.

606
00:34:02,240 --> 00:34:03,490
I tore it apart

607
00:34:04,440 --> 00:34:05,730
and escaped.

608
00:34:07,750 --> 00:34:09,300
So even a creation of divine craftsmanship

609
00:34:09,670 --> 00:34:11,170
is nothing

610
00:34:11,480 --> 00:34:12,780
against overwhelming power.

611
00:34:13,480 --> 00:34:14,460
Now that you know,

612
00:34:15,000 --> 00:34:15,740
don't ever

613
00:34:16,960 --> 00:34:18,050
try anything like that again.

614
00:34:21,880 --> 00:34:23,530
I'll behave myself. I promise.

615
00:34:28,550 --> 00:34:30,010
Y-You don't believe me?

616
00:34:30,230 --> 00:34:30,860
What do you think?

617
00:34:39,670 --> 00:34:40,860
Back in the secret passage,

618
00:34:41,280 --> 00:34:42,530
why did you suddenly stop using your powers?

619
00:34:43,480 --> 00:34:44,780
Why did you give Su Hexiang

620
00:34:44,800 --> 00:34:45,570
a chance to strike?

621
00:35:03,190 --> 00:35:03,940
Didn't you already

622
00:35:03,960 --> 00:35:04,860
have it under control?

623
00:35:06,280 --> 00:35:07,300
Since we got here,

624
00:35:08,800 --> 00:35:09,900
the Wanjun Lock

625
00:35:10,110 --> 00:35:10,980
has been growing stronger.

626
00:35:14,710 --> 00:35:15,650
I see.

627
00:35:16,590 --> 00:35:17,980
We're in the territory of the Five Great Sects.

628
00:35:18,840 --> 00:35:20,300
No wonder the Wanjun Lock

629
00:35:20,710 --> 00:35:21,780
has grown stronger.

630
00:35:24,360 --> 00:35:24,740
Oh, right.

631
00:35:25,360 --> 00:35:26,300
Where's Yuwen Hao?

632
00:35:26,800 --> 00:35:28,530
Eerie Cavern had clouded his mind,

633
00:35:28,880 --> 00:35:30,210
and my blood affected him, too.

634
00:35:31,630 --> 00:35:32,340
Enough talking.

635
00:35:32,800 --> 00:35:33,530
Give me your hand.

636
00:35:34,670 --> 00:35:35,530
My ring.

637
00:35:35,710 --> 00:35:37,090
You actually got it back for me?

638
00:35:41,920 --> 00:35:43,780
It'll mask that awful smell of yours.

639
00:35:47,280 --> 00:35:48,900
Are you saying I stink?

640
00:35:49,190 --> 00:35:50,170
Yuwen Hao

641
00:35:50,670 --> 00:35:51,570
is still locked up in there.

642
00:35:57,320 --> 00:35:58,820
You can't use your powers right now.

643
00:35:59,320 --> 00:36:00,460
If Hao were here,

644
00:36:00,670 --> 00:36:01,360
maybe we

645
00:36:01,360 --> 00:36:02,740
could take down Su Hexiang together.

646
00:36:02,960 --> 00:36:03,490
After all,

647
00:36:03,670 --> 00:36:04,820
she's still badly injured

648
00:36:05,110 --> 00:36:05,900
and barely hanging on.

649
00:36:06,920 --> 00:36:08,380
He nearly killed you.

650
00:36:09,800 --> 00:36:10,460
No matter what,

651
00:36:11,550 --> 00:36:12,980
I'm not letting you near him again.

652
00:36:17,150 --> 00:36:18,490
Then doesn't that mean

653
00:36:18,510 --> 00:36:19,210
we're completely out of options?

654
00:36:40,400 --> 00:36:41,780
That should be enough

655
00:36:41,780 --> 00:36:42,500
to scare Su Hexiang.

656
00:36:42,590 --> 00:36:43,130
Let's go.

657
00:36:43,150 --> 00:36:44,380
We're running out of time.

658
00:36:59,150 --> 00:37:00,420
She can follow

659
00:37:00,440 --> 00:37:01,420
the scent of your herbs.

660
00:37:03,070 --> 00:37:04,380
She's got my life in her hands.

661
00:37:05,030 --> 00:37:05,870
She's probably been waiting

662
00:37:05,870 --> 00:37:06,780
to make a deal with us.

663
00:37:20,030 --> 00:37:21,480
Made up her mind already?

664
00:37:22,630 --> 00:37:23,940
Just what I'd expect from

665
00:37:23,940 --> 00:37:24,900
High Immortal Danshen's disciple.

666
00:37:25,670 --> 00:37:26,530
She's pretty sharp.

667
00:37:35,670 --> 00:37:36,650
It's your choice.

668
00:37:38,840 --> 00:37:39,820
This is your last chance

669
00:37:39,840 --> 00:37:41,010
to save Xiangxue.

670
00:38:17,030 --> 00:38:18,460
You really are badly hurt.

671
00:38:18,840 --> 00:38:20,260
What a shame about that body of yours.

672
00:38:20,800 --> 00:38:21,900
It can heal almost anything,

673
00:38:22,510 --> 00:38:23,820
yet it can't save your own life.

674
00:38:24,030 --> 00:38:25,530
Still mocking me at a time like this?

675
00:38:25,920 --> 00:38:27,260
You're hardly any better off than I am.

676
00:38:28,710 --> 00:38:29,860
I have no interest in killing you.

677
00:38:31,030 --> 00:38:32,530
I just want my malice back.

678
00:38:32,880 --> 00:38:33,820
But first,

679
00:38:34,070 --> 00:38:35,090
heal her wounds.

680
00:38:39,190 --> 00:38:40,130
Who would've thought?

681
00:38:40,760 --> 00:38:41,560
The devil who strikes fear

682
00:38:41,560 --> 00:38:43,160
into the whole world

683
00:38:43,550 --> 00:38:44,610
has been completely tamed

684
00:38:44,610 --> 00:38:45,820
by a little girl.

685
00:38:47,440 --> 00:38:48,860
Such a scrawny little thing,

686
00:38:50,110 --> 00:38:51,380
yet you're quite taken with her.

687
00:38:52,320 --> 00:38:53,260
Then let's make a deal.

688
00:38:54,400 --> 00:38:55,970
Start by healing her.

689
00:39:59,200 --> 00:39:59,880
Su Hexiang!

690
00:39:59,880 --> 00:40:00,690
What are you doing?

691
00:40:06,670 --> 00:40:08,130
You're still after my herb core?

692
00:40:09,960 --> 00:40:11,340
Even if you get my herb core,

693
00:40:11,710 --> 00:40:12,690
you're still going to die.

694
00:40:13,150 --> 00:40:14,340
Why are you so determined to eat me?

695
00:40:14,880 --> 00:40:15,980
Why would I eat you?

696
00:40:17,230 --> 00:40:18,820
I'm the leader of Mount Leiguan.

697
00:40:19,550 --> 00:40:20,650
My immortal powers are already unmatched.

698
00:40:21,400 --> 00:40:22,490
What would I gain from eating you?

699
00:40:38,000 --> 00:40:38,650
Your herb core

700
00:40:41,110 --> 00:40:42,460
is meant to save Liangsheng.

701
00:40:42,710 --> 00:40:43,820
Don't you hate Lu Liangsheng

702
00:40:44,140 --> 00:40:45,100
with all your heart?

703
00:40:45,320 --> 00:40:46,260
Haven't you been tormenting him?

704
00:40:46,710 --> 00:40:47,170
Yes!

705
00:40:49,590 --> 00:40:50,170
I wish I could

706
00:40:50,190 --> 00:40:51,460
torment him for all eternity.

707
00:40:53,480 --> 00:40:54,860
But mortals are so fragile.

708
00:40:56,070 --> 00:40:57,570
In less than 20 years,

709
00:40:58,880 --> 00:41:00,460
he's already so ill he could die.

710
00:41:03,230 --> 00:41:03,900
I won't let him

711
00:41:03,920 --> 00:41:04,860
leave me like this.

712
00:41:07,230 --> 00:41:07,900
So

713
00:41:08,800 --> 00:41:09,980
you were willing to risk your life

714
00:41:10,480 --> 00:41:11,380
by entering Mount Qihuang

715
00:41:11,960 --> 00:41:13,210
just to save Lu Liangsheng?

716
00:41:13,760 --> 00:41:15,690
You'd even die for him.

717
00:41:16,110 --> 00:41:17,130
Is that really hatred?

718
00:41:50,440 --> 00:41:51,210
I'm fine.

719
00:41:56,320 --> 00:41:57,260
Your mystical flower is fine, too.

720
00:41:57,880 --> 00:41:58,940
She's already expelled the poison.

721
00:42:00,670 --> 00:42:01,940
If you love Lu Liangsheng,

722
00:42:02,400 --> 00:42:04,010
why don't you tell him how you feel?

723
00:42:05,150 --> 00:42:06,460
What good

724
00:42:08,630 --> 00:42:09,650
would that do?

725
00:42:13,550 --> 00:42:15,340
From the moment he first saw me,

726
00:42:17,400 --> 00:42:19,090
he was bound to fear me

727
00:42:20,510 --> 00:42:21,460
and despise me.

728
00:42:27,360 --> 00:42:28,530
But I only killed someone by accident

729
00:42:28,550 --> 00:42:29,690
because I was trying to save him!

730
00:42:30,150 --> 00:42:30,860
Why is that fair?

731
00:42:32,360 --> 00:42:33,210
He loves Xiangxue

732
00:42:34,230 --> 00:42:35,520
only because her hands

733
00:42:35,520 --> 00:42:36,370
have never been stained with blood.

734
00:42:37,110 --> 00:42:38,010
She's different from me.

735
00:42:39,880 --> 00:42:40,980
She's innocent.

736
00:42:43,760 --> 00:42:45,130
You lured Xiangxue into Eerie Cavern.

737
00:42:45,760 --> 00:42:46,490
Lu Liangsheng will never

738
00:42:46,510 --> 00:42:47,380
forgive you for that.

739
00:42:47,670 --> 00:42:49,300
What good is his forgiveness?

740
00:42:50,280 --> 00:42:51,900
I just want him by my side.

741
00:42:53,510 --> 00:42:54,740
Nothing else matters.

742
00:43:01,360 --> 00:43:02,420
I don't care

743
00:43:02,440 --> 00:43:03,260
about your past.

744
00:43:03,590 --> 00:43:05,170
I only want my malice back.

745
00:43:06,030 --> 00:43:06,610
Give it back.

746
00:43:13,070 --> 00:43:14,130
Why can't you retrieve the malice?

747
00:43:14,630 --> 00:43:15,530
It's still inside her.

748
00:43:16,360 --> 00:43:17,210
But it's tangled up

749
00:43:17,210 --> 00:43:18,260
in her deepest desires.

750
00:43:21,070 --> 00:43:22,260
Aren't you curious

751
00:43:22,590 --> 00:43:23,820
where Lu Liangsheng went?

752
00:43:28,510 --> 00:43:29,260
He...

753
00:43:32,360 --> 00:43:33,610
He went to save Xiangxue.

754
00:43:36,230 --> 00:43:37,900
He needs hair from a thousand men,

755
00:43:38,280 --> 00:43:39,210
twisted into a rope,

756
00:43:39,670 --> 00:43:41,300
to pull Xiangxue out of Eerie Cavern.

757
00:43:42,880 --> 00:43:43,780
He's still one man short.

758
00:43:44,320 --> 00:43:45,090
That's right.

759
00:43:45,920 --> 00:43:46,940
I told him

760
00:43:47,400 --> 00:43:49,130
he needs hair from one more dead man

761
00:43:50,840 --> 00:43:52,180
to save Xiangxue.

762
00:43:52,480 --> 00:43:53,570
Why would you do that?

763
00:44:00,670 --> 00:44:02,210
I want to force him to kill with his own hands!

764
00:44:03,320 --> 00:44:04,940
I'll drag him down into the darkness,

765
00:44:05,230 --> 00:44:05,900
just like me,

766
00:44:07,110 --> 00:44:08,340
with blood on his hands.

767
00:44:10,280 --> 00:44:11,300
Only then

768
00:44:12,440 --> 00:44:13,690
will he stop looking down on me.

769
00:44:15,800 --> 00:44:17,130
Even if he saves Xiangxue,

770
00:44:18,320 --> 00:44:19,460
he won't deserve her anymore!

771
00:44:21,710 --> 00:44:22,980
He'll be just like me.

772
00:44:24,760 --> 00:44:26,260
And he'll have no one but me!

773
00:44:31,510 --> 00:44:32,170
You're wrong.

774
00:44:33,510 --> 00:44:34,740
He won't kill anyone.

775
00:44:35,400 --> 00:44:36,860
How long have you even known him?

776
00:44:37,920 --> 00:44:39,130
What makes you so sure?

777
00:44:40,440 --> 00:44:41,300
Where did he go?

778
00:44:42,070 --> 00:44:43,380
Who did you tell him to kill?

779
00:44:44,590 --> 00:44:45,390
A man like him,

780
00:44:45,390 --> 00:44:46,860
who can barely defend himself,

781
00:44:48,630 --> 00:44:49,900
someone he could easily kill...

782
00:44:52,110 --> 00:44:53,040
Wouldn't that be the man

783
00:44:53,040 --> 00:44:54,340
you locked up in the secret passage?

784
00:44:56,800 --> 00:44:57,490
Hao.

785
00:45:29,400 --> 00:45:30,860
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

786
00:45:31,230 --> 00:45:31,570
I...

787
00:45:32,670 --> 00:45:33,570
I'm doing this for Xiangxue.

788
00:45:35,840 --> 00:45:36,610
I have no choice.

789
00:45:40,760 --> 00:45:41,530
Liangsheng!

790
00:45:48,670 --> 00:45:49,340
Help me!

791
00:46:01,710 --> 00:46:02,560
When did you take that?

792
00:46:02,670 --> 00:46:03,910
Last night, while you were unconscious,

793
00:46:03,910 --> 00:46:05,580
you told me everything, secrets and all.

794
00:46:05,920 --> 00:46:07,490
I figured having this would be worth more

795
00:46:07,710 --> 00:46:08,820
than ten thousand promises

796
00:46:08,840 --> 00:46:09,460
from you.

797
00:46:11,000 --> 00:46:11,690
Qi Fengyin!

798
00:46:13,320 --> 00:46:15,260
To stop Qi Fengyin from becoming the Devil Incarnate,

799
00:46:15,320 --> 00:46:17,480
we must cut out Yamao's herb core.

800
00:46:17,920 --> 00:46:18,900
Darling, you're awake.

801
00:46:40,620 --> 00:46:44,660
♪See this world where flowers have yet to bloom♪

802
00:46:44,900 --> 00:46:48,340
♪So many longings♪

803
00:46:49,020 --> 00:46:51,100
♪Linger in the web of fate♪

804
00:46:51,300 --> 00:46:56,300
♪Then vanish like mist in a moment♪

805
00:46:57,220 --> 00:47:01,260
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

806
00:47:01,500 --> 00:47:04,940
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

807
00:47:05,620 --> 00:47:07,700
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

808
00:47:07,900 --> 00:47:15,300
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

809
00:47:16,700 --> 00:47:20,380
♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪

810
00:47:20,620 --> 00:47:24,300
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪

811
00:47:24,940 --> 00:47:28,500
♪The wish we made in the long night♪

812
00:47:28,820 --> 00:47:32,980
♪Still waits to come true♪

813
00:47:33,220 --> 00:47:36,900
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

814
00:47:37,460 --> 00:47:41,100
♪I'll stay by your side♪

815
00:47:41,580 --> 00:47:45,180
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

816
00:47:45,420 --> 00:47:52,740
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪

817
00:48:06,220 --> 00:48:10,260
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

818
00:48:10,500 --> 00:48:13,940
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

819
00:48:14,620 --> 00:48:16,700
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

820
00:48:16,860 --> 00:48:24,300
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

821
00:48:25,220 --> 00:48:28,900
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

822
00:48:29,500 --> 00:48:33,100
♪I'll stay by your side♪

823
00:48:33,620 --> 00:48:37,180
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

824
00:48:37,420 --> 00:48:44,740
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪
